OL,3,GNEWSAMeet the hugger helping strangers
OL,4,Aopen up
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring the day, 24b@Qyearb@Qold father
OL,7,Fof two Aiden Opie is a team leader at a
OL,8,Fconcrete factory.
OL,10,FIn the evenings, when he's not making
OL,11,Fconcrete, he's standing in the streets
OL,12,Fof Nottingham city centre offering hugs
OL,13,Fand creating a space for people to talk
OL,14,Fopenly about their mental health,
OL,15,Fsomething he says he has struggled with
OL,16,Ffor most of his life.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
