OL,3,GNEWSAMeet the hugger helping strangers
OL,4,Aopen up
OL,5,
OL,6,FEvery weekday he travels from his home
OL,7,Fin The Meadows, picks a spot in the
OL,8,Fcity centre, sets up his camera, and
OL,9,Fstands still among the bustle of the
OL,10,Fhigh street holding a sign that reads:
OL,11,F"If you have ever struggled with
OL,12,Fanxiety or depression, hug me".
OL,14,FHe posts some of his interactions on
OL,15,FTikTok, where he has more than 155,000
OL,16,Ffollowers and some videos have reached
OL,17,Fmore than a million views.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
